The target design should be able to distinguish:

- transaction currency;
- transaction-currency debit/credit;
- exchange rate;
- base-currency debit/credit.

Example:

Transaction:

USD 1,000

Rate:

1 USD = 83.50 INR

Journal:

| Account             |               Currency |         Foreign Amount |  Base Amount |
| ------------------- | ---------------------: | ---------------------: | -----------: |
| Accounts Receivable |                    USD |            Dr 1,000.00 | Dr 83,500.00 |
| Revenue             | USD/base as applicable | Cr 1,000.00 equivalent | Cr 83,500.00 |

Do not blindly apply this example to every journal.

The implementation must follow the actual account/document semantics.

